        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2015, LIGO made the world’s first direct detection of gravitational waves with the event GW150914, confirming for the first time in history the existence of binary black hole systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In most space-themed games, you pilot a spaceship or colonize planets. But in this game, you become a celestial body. Start as a lonely asteroid, grow by absorbing smaller objects, and evolve step by step—from asteroid to planet, to star, and ultimately to a black hole that devours everything. All of this unfolds in a vast sandbox universe driven by real physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain mass by absorbing smaller asteroids and progress through multiple cosmic stages, each unlocking new abilities and challenges:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a planet, nurture life and protect your own world;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a star, your powerful gravity can capture planets and build your own planetary system;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a black hole, nothing can escape your grasp.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore freely in a universe governed by authentic gravitational and orbital mechanics, and create your own cosmic system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Growth System: Evolve from an asteroid to a planet, a star, and finally a black hole, each stage offering unique gameplay and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Physics Simulation: Experience lifelike gravity and orbital mechanics—construct stable planetary systems or trigger spectacular collisions and chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Sandbox Universe: An ever-evolving universe where new celestial bodies and events continually emerge, and cosmic evolution never stops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Binary Black Holes: As the binary black holes grow and spiral toward each other, will you survive—or be swallowed by the void?</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2015, LIGO made the world’s first direct detection of gravitational waves with the event GW150914, confirming for the first time in history the existence of binary black hole systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In most space-themed games, you pilot a spaceship or colonize planets. But in this game, you become a celestial body. Start as a lonely asteroid, grow by absorbing smaller objects, and evolve step by step—from asteroid to planet, to star, and ultimately to a black hole that devours everything. All of this unfolds in a vast sandbox universe driven by real physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain mass by absorbing smaller asteroids and progress through multiple cosmic stages, each unlocking new abilities and challenges:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a planet, nurture life and protect your own world;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a star, your powerful gravity can capture planets and build your own planetary system;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a black hole, nothing can escape your grasp.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore freely in a universe governed by authentic gravitational and orbital mechanics, and create your own cosmic system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Growth System: Evolve from an asteroid to a planet, a star, and finally a black hole, each stage offering unique gameplay and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Physics Simulation: Experience lifelike gravity and orbital mechanics—construct stable planetary systems or trigger spectacular collisions and chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Sandbox Universe: An ever-evolving universe where new celestial bodies and events continually emerge, and cosmic evolution never stops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Binary Black Holes: As the binary black holes grow and spiral toward each other, will you survive—or be swallowed by the void?</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Start as an asteroid, grow by absorbing other celestial bodies to become a planet, a star, and ultimately a black hole. Experience realistic gravity and orbital physics in an ever-evolving sandbox universe.",
        "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Ukrainian, Russian, Bulgarian, Hungarian, Turkish, Greek, Norwegian, Czech, Japanese, Polish, Swedish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Romanian, Finnish, Dutch, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Vietnamese, Korean, Thai, Indonesian, Arabic, Malay",
